thegent_autosync_items_total{kind="ignored"} 1
thegent_autosync_items_total{kind="processed"} 1
# HELP thegent_board_sync_cycles_total Total board sync cycles by source and status
# TYPE thegent_board_sync_cycles_total counter
thegent_board_sync_cycles_total{source="github",status="failed"} 2
